WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.296 --> 00:00:03.457
I want total immersion
while I'm here in Berlin,

00:00:03.457 --> 00:00:07.796
so I've asked my good friend
Flula Borg to teach me

00:00:07.796 --> 00:00:09.160
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.315
all things Berlin, German, so that,

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:13.275
no you don't want to?

00:00:13.275 --> 00:00:15.020
This is my, when I'm enthusiastic,

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.181
I just, it's a shaking of all the energies

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:18.861
inside my head to spread it even.

00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:20.039
So that was you saying yes?

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:21.691
Okay, just say yes.

00:00:21.691 --> 00:00:22.524
Yes.

00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:25.078
Okay, Flula is going to help me learn

00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:28.015
all about Berlin, the customs, the people,

00:00:28.015 --> 00:00:29.018
and I thought it'd be nice

00:00:29.018 --> 00:00:30.894
if we also could eat at the same time.

00:00:30.894 --> 00:00:33.387
So let's just go crazy
and order some stuff.

00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:35.390
I love it, do you like hot and cold?

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.718
Do you like both of the temperatures?

00:00:36.718 --> 00:00:39.193
Uh, yes, I love both
of the temperatures.

00:00:39.193 --> 00:00:40.026
(speaks foreign language)

00:00:40.026 --> 00:00:40.859
Perfect.

00:00:40.859 --> 00:00:42.047
This is the slaughter plate.

00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:43.074
This is just everything?

00:00:43.074 --> 00:00:45.611
Oh, yes, the whole kit and caboodle.

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:46.981
And it's just a bunch of animals

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:48.550
were in a bus and it blew up.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.383
Yeah.
(audience laughs)

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:50.216
Yes, perfect.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.618
We'll get a schnitzel as well.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:52.640
What is schnitzel?

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.869
Exactly, let us look at it.

00:00:53.869 --> 00:00:56.492
It's pounded pork with
a nice skin of crumbs.

00:00:56.492 --> 00:00:57.768
Oh, great, terrific.

00:00:57.768 --> 00:00:59.688
You will love it, you will
want to roll around in it.

00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:01.525
Well, I, no.

00:01:01.525 --> 00:01:02.398
[Flula] Look at that.

00:01:02.398 --> 00:01:04.415
That is so much beer.

00:01:04.415 --> 00:01:06.618
It's an exchange rate,
this is one German beer

00:01:06.618 --> 00:01:08.612
which equals 45 Bud Lights.

00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:10.612
Okay, so what do I do, you just?

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:11.525
Yeah, prost.

00:01:11.525 --> 00:01:12.874
Prost, we must toast.

00:01:12.874 --> 00:01:14.009
Always with the eyes.

00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:15.360
You cannot look at like a plant.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.796
So it would be very rude if I was

00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:18.597
like prost, that would be bad.

00:01:18.597 --> 00:01:19.430
I would not drink with you.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:23.597
I'd pour this into my
testicles, I would not drink it.

00:01:26.222 --> 00:01:27.594
When do we stop looking at each other?

00:01:27.594 --> 00:01:28.427
We don't.

00:01:28.427 --> 00:01:29.605
And is there a kiss at some point?

00:01:29.605 --> 00:01:32.011
We may smooch it, it is an option.

00:01:32.011 --> 00:01:33.150
Prost, where are you from?

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:34.138
Vietnam.

00:01:34.138 --> 00:01:34.971
You're from Vietnam?

00:01:34.971 --> 00:01:36.398
Prost!
Prost!

00:01:36.398 --> 00:01:38.540
Here comes the slaughter.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.040
Slaughter platter.

00:01:41.306 --> 00:01:44.447
(audience laughs)

00:01:44.447 --> 00:01:45.617
Keep looking.

00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:47.063
Don't fear it.

00:01:47.063 --> 00:01:48.637
Sexually this town feels very

00:01:48.637 --> 00:01:50.765
uninhibited like they love the sex.

00:01:50.765 --> 00:01:52.835
They love the freedom of it, is that true?

00:01:52.835 --> 00:01:53.927
Why are we hiding it?

00:01:53.927 --> 00:01:54.917
Do you know?

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.906
It's like if you are having
a nice comic book collection,

00:01:56.906 --> 00:01:59.246
would you hide Amazing
Spiderman number eight?

00:01:59.246 --> 00:02:00.657
(audience laughs)

00:02:00.657 --> 00:02:01.628
No.

00:02:01.628 --> 00:02:02.461
No you would put it on the wall

00:02:02.461 --> 00:02:03.756
and show all of your neighbors.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.024
Okay.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.621
Do you need to know some phrases?

00:02:06.621 --> 00:02:08.280
I can teach you some happy phrases.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.504
Teach me some phrases.

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:11.657
If you like something,
it's very delicious you say.

00:02:11.657 --> 00:02:13.141
(speaks foreign language)

00:02:13.141 --> 00:02:14.766
(speaks foreign language)

00:02:14.766 --> 00:02:16.170
Which means I could sit in it.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:18.354
The image is I would
make a tub of this food

00:02:18.354 --> 00:02:19.971
and then I would bathe inside it.

00:02:19.971 --> 00:02:22.602
(audience laughs)

00:02:22.602 --> 00:02:24.220
(speaks foreign language)

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:28.002
(speaks foreign language)

00:02:28.002 --> 00:02:29.684
Which means you probably do not have

00:02:29.684 --> 00:02:32.258
all of the cups inside your cupboard.

00:02:32.258 --> 00:02:33.925
(audience laughs)

00:02:33.925 --> 00:02:34.936
Means you are cuckoo.

00:02:34.936 --> 00:02:36.028
Oh you're cuckoo.

00:02:36.028 --> 00:02:37.369
(audience laughs)

00:02:37.369 --> 00:02:38.880
You don't have all the
cups inside your cupboard?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.072
You have an incomplete cupboard.

00:02:40.072 --> 00:02:42.673
(audience laughs)

00:02:42.673 --> 00:02:43.993
[Conan] Can you teach
me any drinking songs?

00:02:43.993 --> 00:02:47.524
Yeah, there's one called,
“One more will fit inside you.”

00:02:47.524 --> 00:02:48.964
One more will fit inside you?

00:02:48.964 --> 00:02:49.797
Yeah.

00:02:49.797 --> 00:02:50.940
(audience laughs)

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:51.964
Beer.
Yeah.

00:02:51.964 --> 00:02:53.131
Well yes beer.

00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:58.137
(singing in foreign language)

00:03:24.045 --> 00:03:26.295
(laughing)

